WEBVTT

00:10.814 --> 00:12.447
[Plankton humming]
[浮游生物的嗡嗡声]

00:12.447 --> 00:15.047
- Oh, Planky-bear.
- 哦，板条熊。

00:15.047 --> 00:16.847
Plankton.
浮游生物。

00:16.847 --> 00:18.647
- [continues humming]
- [继续哼唱]

00:18.647 --> 00:19.647
- Plankton!
- 浮游生物！

00:19.647 --> 00:20.814
- What?
- 什么？

00:20.814 --> 00:22.080
What is it, Karen?
这是什么，凯伦？

00:22.080 --> 00:23.714
Can't you see
I'm working here?
你看不到吗
我在这里工作？

00:23.714 --> 00:25.580
- Yes, but I wanted to show you
- 是的，但我想给你看

00:25.580 --> 00:27.280
my new screen saver.
我的新屏幕保护程序。

00:27.280 --> 00:28.447
What do you think?
你怎么认为？

00:28.447 --> 00:29.447
- Great.
- 伟大的。

00:29.447 --> 00:30.580
- You didn't even look.
- 你连看都没看。

00:30.580 --> 00:32.114
- [sighs]
No, I didn't.
- [叹气]
不，我没有。

00:32.114 --> 00:33.680
Can't you see
I'm working on
你看不到吗
我正在努力

00:33.680 --> 00:35.814
my new molecular analyzer?
我的新分子分析仪？

00:35.814 --> 00:38.980
Now all I need is the
smallest molecule of a patty,
现在我需要的是
肉饼的最小分子，

00:38.980 --> 00:41.014
and the formula
will be mine!
和公式
将是我的！

00:41.014 --> 00:42.314
- Just tell me if I should
- 告诉我是否应该

00:42.314 --> 00:45.347
permanently upload
this screen saver!
永久上传
这个屏幕保护程序！

00:45.347 --> 00:46.814
- I said not...
- 我说不是...

00:46.814 --> 00:49.247
[lever clicks, tube hisses]
Now-ow-ow!
[杠杆咔嗒声，管子嘶嘶声]
现在-噢-噢！

00:49.247 --> 00:50.847
[screams]
[尖叫声]

00:50.847 --> 00:53.214
[Plankton whooshes]
Ow!
[浮游生物呼啸]
噢！

00:54.347 --> 00:55.814
[loud smash]
[大声粉碎]

00:55.814 --> 00:57.814
[gasping]
[喘气]

00:57.814 --> 00:59.580
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

00:59.580 --> 01:01.114
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

01:01.114 --> 01:02.814
[snaps, yelping]
[啪啪，尖叫]

01:02.814 --> 01:04.447
[electricity zaps,
Plankton screams]
[电击，
浮游生物尖叫]

01:04.447 --> 01:07.147
[screaming]
[尖叫]

01:07.147 --> 01:08.347
- Analyzing.
- 分析。

01:08.347 --> 01:10.014
30% mean guy,
30% 刻薄的人，

01:10.014 --> 01:12.280
20% spiteful monster,
20%恶毒的怪物，

01:12.280 --> 01:14.414
50% evil butthead.
50%邪恶的屁股。

01:14.414 --> 01:15.680
Sample is...
样本是...

01:15.680 --> 01:18.414
100% big jerk.
100%大混蛋。

01:19.514 --> 01:21.080
- [grunting, yelps]
- [咕哝，尖叫]

01:21.080 --> 01:22.280
- I have also analyzed
——我也分析过

01:22.280 --> 01:23.814
your screen saver,
Karen.
你的屏幕保护程序，
凯伦。

01:23.814 --> 01:25.480
It is most beautiful.
它是最美丽的。

01:25.480 --> 01:27.347
- No one asked you.
- 没有人问你。

01:27.347 --> 01:28.414
[loud smash]
[大声粉碎]

01:28.414 --> 01:30.180
Are you happy now, Karen?
凯伦，你现在幸福吗？

01:30.180 --> 01:31.447
- No, I'm not.
- 不，我不是。

01:31.447 --> 01:33.980
I was just trying to
make myself pretty for you,
我只是想
为了你，把自己打扮得漂漂亮亮的

01:33.980 --> 01:35.214
but do you even care?
但你关心吗？

01:35.214 --> 01:37.914
All you ever do
is make stupid schemes
你所做的一切
正在制定愚蠢的计划

01:37.914 --> 01:40.147
about stupid sandwiches!
关于愚蠢的三明治！

01:40.147 --> 01:41.280
- Stupid?
- 愚蠢的？

01:41.280 --> 01:43.814
Your new screen saver
is stupid,
您的新屏幕保护程序
是愚蠢的，

01:43.814 --> 01:46.547
and it makes your processor
look fat!
它使你的处理器
看起来很胖！

01:46.547 --> 01:47.647
[explosions]
[爆炸]

01:47.647 --> 01:49.614
- What?
- 什么？

01:49.614 --> 01:50.714
- Oop.
- 哎呀。

01:50.714 --> 01:52.380
Okay, let's all calm down
好吧，让我们都冷静下来

01:52.380 --> 01:54.480
before you say something
you'll regret.
在你说些什么之前
你会后悔的。

01:54.480 --> 01:55.647
- You know what?
- 你知道吗？

01:55.647 --> 01:57.180
No one talks to me
like that.
没有人跟我说话
像那样。

01:57.180 --> 01:58.047
Get out!
出去！

01:58.047 --> 01:59.480
- I will not get out.
- 我不会出去。

01:59.480 --> 02:00.814
This is my restaurant,
这是我的餐厅，

02:00.814 --> 02:02.580
and no one can make me...
而没有人能让我...

02:02.580 --> 02:03.880
leave!
离开！

02:03.880 --> 02:05.480
[thuds]
Ow!
[重击声]
噢！

02:05.480 --> 02:07.347
Karen, baby.
凯伦，宝贝。

02:07.347 --> 02:08.814
Come on, sugar lips,
来吧，糖唇，

02:08.814 --> 02:10.880
you know I'm sorry
for everything I said.
你知道我很抱歉
对于我所说的一切。

02:10.880 --> 02:11.914
[portcullis thuds,
Plankton yelps]
[闸门重击，
浮游生物尖叫]

02:11.914 --> 02:13.214
- I accept your apology.
- 我接受你的道歉。

02:13.214 --> 02:15.714
- I wasn't talking to you,
idiot!
-我不是在跟你说话
白痴！

02:15.714 --> 02:17.647
[squishes, Plankton screams]
[压扁，浮游生物尖叫]

02:17.647 --> 02:19.014
Pain!
疼痛！

02:20.047 --> 02:21.947
Okay, Karen, fun is fun,
好吧，凯伦，有趣就是有趣，

02:21.947 --> 02:23.814
but it's time to let me back in.
但现在是让我回去的时候了。

02:23.814 --> 02:26.214
Come on, I really
need to use the potty!
来吧，我真的
需要使用便盆！

02:26.214 --> 02:27.947
[metal doors thud, lasers hum]
[金属门砰的一声，激光发出嗡嗡声]

02:27.947 --> 02:30.814
Fine, I don't need you
or the Chum Bucket!
好吧，我不需要你
或者密友桶！

02:30.814 --> 02:32.714
I got plenty of friends
around here
我有很多朋友
在这附近

02:32.714 --> 02:34.347
who would love to take me in.
谁愿意带我进去。

02:35.714 --> 02:37.947
So is it cool if I crash here?
- No.
那么如果我在这里崩溃是不是很酷？
- 不。

02:37.947 --> 02:39.814
- Then can I just
use your bath room?
- 那我可以吗
使用你的浴室吗？

02:39.814 --> 02:41.080
[thuds, yelps]
[重击声，尖叫声]

02:41.080 --> 02:42.880
- Plankton, I know
where this is going.
- 浮游生物，我知道
这是怎么回事。

02:42.880 --> 02:45.247
I'd love it
if you'd stay with me!
我会喜欢的
如果你愿意留在我身边！

02:45.247 --> 02:46.580
- Are you crazy?
- 你疯了？

02:46.580 --> 02:48.714
You're the most annoying sponge
in the sea.
你是最烦人的海绵
在海里。

02:48.714 --> 02:50.147
I wouldn't stay with you
我不会和你呆在一起

02:50.147 --> 02:52.714
if you were the last person
in Bikini Bottom.
如果你是最后一个人
在比基尼底部。

02:52.714 --> 02:53.814
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

02:53.814 --> 02:55.414
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

02:55.414 --> 02:56.414
- Suit yourself.
- 适合你自己。

02:56.414 --> 02:57.414
[slurping resumes]
[吞咽简历]

02:57.414 --> 02:59.247
- Okay, fine!
- 好吧，好吧！

02:59.247 --> 03:01.347
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:02.880 --> 03:04.214
[toilet flushes]
[厕所冲水]

03:04.214 --> 03:05.414
Whew!
哇！

03:05.414 --> 03:06.814
Much better.
好多了。

03:06.814 --> 03:08.314
Thanks for letting me
use your bathroom.
谢谢你让我
使用你的浴室。

03:08.314 --> 03:10.214
- [laughs]
Silly, that's not my bathroom.
- [笑]
傻了，那不是我的浴室。

03:10.214 --> 03:11.447
- Well, in that case,
- 那么，在这种情况下，

03:11.447 --> 03:12.914
you're gonna need
some new shoes.
你会需要
一些新鞋。

03:12.914 --> 03:14.314
- Oh, boy!
- 哦，孩子！

03:14.314 --> 03:16.347
Does this mean
you're gonna stay with me?
这是否意味着
你会留下来陪我吗？

03:16.347 --> 03:17.647
- Yes!
- 是的！

03:17.647 --> 03:18.814
- Yeah!
- 是的！

03:18.814 --> 03:20.580
[celebratory fanfare]
[庆祝的乐曲]

03:20.580 --> 03:22.880
We're gonna be
the best roommates ever!
我们将会是
有史以来最好的室友！

03:22.880 --> 03:24.814
Oh!
Wanna do each other's hair?
哦！
想给对方做头发吗？

03:24.814 --> 03:27.314
[laughs]
- Oh, forget this!
[笑]
- 哦，忘了这个吧！

03:27.314 --> 03:29.347
- [laughs]
- [笑]

03:32.080 --> 03:35.414
- Oh, my love,
what a fool I've been.
- 哦，我的爱人，
我真是个傻瓜。

03:35.414 --> 03:38.480
You've always been
the only one for me.
你一直都是
唯一适合我的。

03:38.480 --> 03:39.614
[both smooching]
[两人接吻]

03:39.614 --> 03:44.480
- [sniffling]
- [抽鼻子]

03:44.480 --> 03:45.714
- Aw, Plankton.
- 噢，浮游生物。

03:45.714 --> 03:46.814
I am so sorry that
我很抱歉

03:46.814 --> 03:48.480
Karen threw you out.
凯伦把你赶了出去。

03:48.480 --> 03:49.814
- Threw me out?
- 把我赶出去？

03:49.814 --> 03:51.347
I threw her in!
我把她扔进去了！

03:51.347 --> 03:53.480
- Hey, this is
your safe place.
- 嘿，这是
你安全的地方。

03:53.480 --> 03:56.480
It's okay to talk about
your feelings.
没关系谈论
你的感受。

03:56.480 --> 03:57.880
Oh, somebody's tense!
哦，有人紧张！

03:57.880 --> 03:59.247
- Hey!
What?
- 嘿！
什么？

03:59.247 --> 04:00.247
Get off!
下车！

04:00.247 --> 04:01.480
Get--Oh!
得到——哦！

04:01.480 --> 04:03.580
[moaning, laughs]
[呻吟，大笑]

04:03.580 --> 04:05.147
Oh,
that's the spot.
哦，
就是那个地方。

04:05.147 --> 04:08.114
- Now, tell SpongeBob why
you and Karen got into a fight.
- 现在，告诉海绵宝宝为什么
你和凯伦打架了。

04:08.114 --> 04:10.014
- I don't know,
I was just doing
- 我不知道，
我刚刚在做

04:10.014 --> 04:11.947
the same things I always do.
我总是做同样的事情。

04:11.947 --> 04:13.347
- Well, if Karen
threw you out
- 好吧，如果凯伦
把你赶出去

04:13.347 --> 04:15.080
for doing the same things
you always do,
为了做同样的事情
你总是这样做，

04:15.080 --> 04:17.014
maybe you should learn
to not do
也许你应该学习
不做

04:17.014 --> 04:18.680
the same things
you always do!
同样的事情
你总是这样！

04:18.680 --> 04:20.014
- But I'm the best.
- 但我是最好的。

04:20.014 --> 04:21.714
- Well, sometimes
you can get a little...
- 嗯，有时
你可以得到一点...

04:21.714 --> 04:22.814
aggressive.
挑衅的。

04:22.814 --> 04:24.547
- Me, aggressive?
- 我，有攻击性？

04:24.547 --> 04:25.947
How dare you?
你怎么敢？

04:25.947 --> 04:29.614
[smacking and grunting]
[咂嘴和咕哝]

04:29.614 --> 04:31.014
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:31.014 --> 04:32.347
Maybe you're right.
也许你是对的。

04:32.347 --> 04:35.080
I can be a big jerk
sometimes.
我可能是个大混蛋
有时。

04:35.080 --> 04:38.980
I command you to help me
be a nicer person!
我命令你帮助我
做一个更好的人！

04:40.680 --> 04:42.414
I mean, will you please,
我的意思是，请你，

04:42.414 --> 04:44.814
please help me
be a nicer person
请帮助我
做一个更好的人

04:44.814 --> 04:47.180
so Karen
will take me back?
苏凯伦
会带我回去吗？

04:47.180 --> 04:50.080
- Plankton, in a word: yes!
- 浮游生物，一句话：是的！

04:52.514 --> 04:54.814
- What is that dimwit
doing here?
- 那个傻瓜是什么
在这里做什么？

04:54.814 --> 04:56.547
- Ahh!
Oh, behind me!
- 啊！
噢，在我身后！

04:56.547 --> 04:58.580
Oh, get away!
噢，走开！

04:58.580 --> 05:00.014
- Will you stop that?
- 你能阻止吗？

05:00.014 --> 05:01.547
There's no one behind you!
你身后没有人！

05:01.547 --> 05:03.480
You're the dimwit.
你就是那个笨蛋。

05:03.480 --> 05:05.847
- Oh.
- 哦。

05:05.847 --> 05:06.914
Thanks!
谢谢！

05:06.914 --> 05:08.314
- All right, Plankton,
- 好吧，浮游生物，

05:08.314 --> 05:10.080
the first step
to becoming a nicer person
第一步
成为一个更好的人

05:10.080 --> 05:11.814
is being thoughtful.
正在深思熟虑。

05:11.814 --> 05:13.247
Try holding a door
for someone.
尝试扶着门
对于某人。

05:13.247 --> 05:15.847
It's simple,
and it makes people happy.
很简单，
它使人们快乐。

05:15.847 --> 05:17.080
Like this.
像这样。

05:17.080 --> 05:18.347
After you.
您先请。

05:18.347 --> 05:21.014
- [laughs]
I'm happy, SpongeBob!
- [笑]
我很高兴，海绵宝宝！

05:21.014 --> 05:22.080
[smooches]
[亲吻]

05:22.080 --> 05:24.080
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:24.080 --> 05:26.447
- Can someone
get me out of here?
- 有人可以吗
带我离开这里？

05:26.447 --> 05:28.147
Whew!
哇！

05:28.147 --> 05:29.714
- All right, Plankton.
Now you try!
- 好吧，浮游生物。
现在你试试吧！

05:29.714 --> 05:32.547
- Fine, but if he kisses me,
I'm gonna lose it.
- 好吧，但如果他吻我，
我会失去它。

05:32.547 --> 05:34.980
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

05:34.980 --> 05:38.080
- Ugh.
After you.
- 呃。
您先请。

05:38.080 --> 05:41.214
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:42.914 --> 05:46.347
[continues grunting]
[继续咕哝]

05:46.347 --> 05:47.280
Whoa!
哇！

05:49.447 --> 05:51.680
- Try this one.
- 试试这个。

05:51.680 --> 05:53.114
- After you.
- 您先请。

05:53.114 --> 05:55.080
- But I can't fit through there.
- 但我无法通过那里。

05:55.080 --> 05:58.014
- How dare you
reject my act of kindness!
- 你怎么敢
拒绝我的善举！

05:58.014 --> 05:59.414
Yah!
- Ahh!
啊！
- 啊！

05:59.414 --> 06:01.680
[Patrick thuds,
Plankton smacks and grunts]
[帕特里克重击，
浮游生物拍打着并发出咕噜声]

06:01.680 --> 06:02.914
- Plankton, no!
- 浮游生物，不！

06:02.914 --> 06:04.647
- Can someone
get me out of here?
- 有人可以吗
带我离开这里？

06:04.647 --> 06:06.380
- [Plankton smacks and grunts]
- [sighs]
- [浮游生物拍打和咕噜声]
- [叹气]

06:07.814 --> 06:09.347
Okay, Plankton,
好吧，浮游生物，

06:09.347 --> 06:11.147
since you don't seem to be able
to do something nice,
因为你似乎无法
做一些美好的事情，

06:11.147 --> 06:12.814
in this lesson
you're going to learn
在本课中
你将会学到

06:12.814 --> 06:14.114
to say something nice.
说一些好话。

06:14.114 --> 06:15.447
- Easy!
- 简单的！

06:15.447 --> 06:16.680
- Great.
- 伟大的。

06:16.680 --> 06:18.247
So turn to Patrick
and say something nice.
所以转向帕特里克
并说一些好听的话。

06:20.814 --> 06:22.814
- Say something nice.
- 说一些好听的话。

06:22.814 --> 06:23.980
- Uh...
- 呃...

06:23.980 --> 06:28.147
Patrick,
you are not a total moron.
帕特里克，
你不是个十足的白痴。

06:28.147 --> 06:29.480
Just half of one.
只有一半。

06:29.480 --> 06:30.647
- No, try again.
- 不，再试一次。

06:30.647 --> 06:31.814
- Fine.
- 美好的。

06:31.814 --> 06:34.980
Your color pink
is not so repugnant.
你的颜色粉红色
并不是那么令人反感。

06:34.980 --> 06:36.047
- Thanks!
- 谢谢！

06:36.047 --> 06:37.680
I like...um...
我喜欢……嗯……

06:37.680 --> 06:39.314
your antennas.
你的天线。

06:39.314 --> 06:42.080
- What?
What's wrong with my antennas?
- 什么？
我的天线出了什么问题？

06:42.080 --> 06:43.980
- Plankton, Patrick was
complimenting you.
- 浮游生物，帕特里克
恭维你。

06:43.980 --> 06:44.980
- Yeah, right.
- 是的，对。

06:44.980 --> 06:46.980
You two are mocking me!
你们两个在嘲笑我！

06:46.980 --> 06:48.014
[smacking and grunting]
[咂嘴和咕哝]

06:48.014 --> 06:49.314
- Hey, SpongeBob?
- 嘿，海绵宝宝？

06:49.314 --> 06:51.714
Do you think
this is working?
你认为
这有效吗？

06:51.714 --> 06:53.980
- No, I think we better
try something else.
- 不，我认为我们更好
尝试别的东西。

06:53.980 --> 06:54.980
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:54.980 --> 06:57.114
[gasps,panting]
[喘气，气喘吁吁]

06:58.680 --> 07:01.147
It's no use, SpongeBob.
这是没有用的，海绵宝宝。

07:01.147 --> 07:03.480
I'm just too brilliant
to be nice.
我只是太聪明了
表现得友善。

07:03.480 --> 07:05.680
I'll never get Karen back now.
我现在永远不会让凯伦回来了。

07:05.680 --> 07:07.180
- Oh, yes, you will!
- 哦，是的，你会的！

07:07.180 --> 07:09.880
We obviously can't fix
your terrible insides,
我们显然无法修复
你可怕的内心，

07:09.880 --> 07:11.447
but maybe, just maybe,
但也许，只是也许，

07:11.447 --> 07:14.580
we can work on
your terrible outsides.
我们可以努力
你可怕的外表。

07:14.580 --> 07:15.680
Makeover time!
改头换面时间到了！

07:16.880 --> 07:18.047
[scissors snipping]
[剪刀剪断]

07:18.047 --> 07:19.414
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

07:19.414 --> 07:21.680
[laughs]
[笑]

07:21.680 --> 07:24.680
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

07:24.680 --> 07:29.047
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:29.047 --> 07:30.214
- Brother.
- 兄弟。

07:30.214 --> 07:31.214
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:31.214 --> 07:32.814
- [laughing gleefully]
- [高兴地笑]

07:32.814 --> 07:36.680
**
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:36.680 --> 07:38.514
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:40.114 --> 07:41.547
[crashing]
[崩溃]

07:43.214 --> 07:45.314
Forget it, SpongeBob.
忘了它吧，海绵宝宝。

07:45.314 --> 07:47.280
Karen's the perfect woman:
凯伦是完美的女人：

07:47.280 --> 07:49.680
so smart, so conniving.
如此聪明，如此纵容。

07:49.680 --> 07:52.814
Ah, she's never
gonna take me back.
啊，她从来没有
会带我回去的

07:52.814 --> 07:53.980
- Oh, yes, she is.
- 哦，是的，她是。

07:53.980 --> 07:55.880
You just need to
do something big.
你只需要
做一些大事。

07:55.880 --> 07:57.814
Be vulnerable, be sweet.
变得脆弱，变得甜蜜。

07:57.814 --> 07:59.314
Show Karen your heart.
向凯伦展示你的心。

07:59.314 --> 08:01.447
- That's a great idea!
- 这是个好主意！

08:01.447 --> 08:03.980
I'll cook up a scheme
to make her jealous
我会制定一个计划
让她嫉妒

08:03.980 --> 08:05.514
and crush her spirit!
并粉碎她的精神！

08:05.514 --> 08:06.880
[laughs]
[笑]

08:06.880 --> 08:08.980
- That wasn't even close
to what I said.
- 那还差得很远
我说的。

08:08.980 --> 08:10.047
- Sure it was.
- 当然是。

08:10.047 --> 08:12.147
And I know
just how to do it.
我知道
只是如何去做。

08:12.147 --> 08:13.680
[mimics cat meow]
[模仿猫的叫声]

08:13.680 --> 08:15.347
- Okay,
I feel uncomfortable.
- 好吧，
我感觉不舒服。

08:16.614 --> 08:18.080
Plankton, are you sure
about this?
浮游生物，你确定吗？
关于这个？

08:18.080 --> 08:19.547
- Of course I'm sure.
- 我当然确定。

08:19.547 --> 08:21.980
Now, start doing
a robot voice.
现在，开始做
机器人的声音。

08:21.980 --> 08:24.047
Remember, you're not
SpongeBob anymore;
请记住，你不是
不再是海绵宝宝了；

08:24.047 --> 08:26.214
you're Shelby Naughtica.
你是谢尔比·诺蒂卡。

08:26.214 --> 08:28.414
- [in robot voice]
Oh, I like that!
- [机器人声音]
哦，我喜欢那样！

08:28.414 --> 08:31.147
Boop beep!
Beep boop boop!
噗噗！
嘟嘟嘟！

08:31.147 --> 08:32.880
- Welcome
to the Chum Bucket!
- 欢迎
到密友桶！

08:32.880 --> 08:33.880
Oh.
哦。

08:33.880 --> 08:35.180
It's you.
是你。

08:35.180 --> 08:36.180
What do you want?
你想要什么？

08:36.180 --> 08:37.480
- Yes, hello.
- 是的，你好。

08:37.480 --> 08:40.614
I would like your most
romantic table
我最想要的是你
浪漫的餐桌

08:40.614 --> 08:43.080
for myself
and my beautiful date,
为我自己
和我美丽的约会对象，

08:43.080 --> 08:44.647
Shelby Naughtica,
谢尔比·诺蒂卡,

08:44.647 --> 08:45.780
the robot.
机器人。

08:45.780 --> 08:47.980
- Beep boop!
[laughs robotically]
- 嘟嘟！
[机械地笑]

08:47.980 --> 08:49.580
- Hmm.
- 唔。

08:49.580 --> 08:51.680
Hmm.
唔。

08:51.680 --> 08:53.314
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

08:53.314 --> 08:55.047
Shelby Naughtica, huh?
谢尔比·诺蒂卡，是吧？

08:55.047 --> 08:58.047
Oh, what
a beautiful name.
哦，什么
一个美丽的名字。

08:58.047 --> 08:59.147
- Thank you!
- 谢谢你！

08:59.147 --> 09:00.380
- [grunts]
- Ow!
- [咕哝]
- 噢！

09:00.380 --> 09:02.280
[in robot voice]
I mean, thank you.
[机器人声音]
我的意思是，谢谢。

09:02.280 --> 09:04.847
Whoa!
Beep boop beep bo boop!
哇！
嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟！

09:04.847 --> 09:08.914
- I'll be right back
with our lovers' special.
- 我马上回来
与我们恋人的特别。

09:08.914 --> 09:10.080
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:10.080 --> 09:12.214
This is going so great,
SpongeBob!
这一切进展如此顺利，
海绵宝宝！

09:12.214 --> 09:14.114
Karen is totally jealous.
凯伦非常嫉妒。

09:14.114 --> 09:15.447
- Here we go.
- 开始了。

09:15.447 --> 09:18.280
I whipped up a special batch
of chum for you,
我做了一批特别的
你的密友，

09:18.280 --> 09:20.447
and for your lovely robot date,
为了你可爱的机器人约会，

09:20.447 --> 09:24.347
a bucket of grease
chock-full of nuts and bolts.
一桶油脂
塞满了螺母和螺栓。

09:24.347 --> 09:26.114
- Plankton,
I don't want to eat this!
- 浮游生物，
我不想吃这个！

09:26.114 --> 09:29.214
- Don't you ruin this for me,
SpongeBoob.
- 你别毁了我的一切
海绵宝宝。

09:29.214 --> 09:31.280
Just eat it!
就吃吧！

09:31.280 --> 09:34.047
[metallic clanging, clattering]
[金属叮当声，咔哒声]

09:34.047 --> 09:35.547
[both gulp]
[两人都咽了一口]

09:35.547 --> 09:36.814
Ugh.
啊。

09:36.814 --> 09:38.047
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:38.047 --> 09:40.547
Oh, my dear
Shelby Naughtica,
哦，亲爱的
谢尔比·诺蒂卡,

09:40.547 --> 09:42.614
you are the most
beautiful woman
你是最
美丽的女人

09:42.614 --> 09:44.880
I've ever laid my eye on.
我曾经关注过。

09:44.880 --> 09:46.014
- Oh, Plankton-poo!
- 哦，浮游生物便便！

09:46.014 --> 09:48.114
You say the sweetest things.
你说着最甜蜜的话。

09:48.114 --> 09:50.380
- [scoffs]
Oh, brother.
- [嘲笑]
哦，兄弟。

09:50.380 --> 09:52.980
- I never knew what love was
until I met you.
- 我从来不知道什么是爱
直到我遇见你。

09:52.980 --> 09:54.480
- Oh!
- 哦！

09:54.480 --> 09:57.647
You have made me the happiest
girl robot in the world!
你让我成为最幸福的人
世界上的机器人女孩！

09:57.647 --> 09:59.447
- Hey, you!
- 嘿，你！

09:59.447 --> 10:01.547
Get your hands off my man!
把你的手从我男人身上拿开！

10:01.547 --> 10:03.447
- You better step off, lady.
- 你最好走开，女士。

10:03.447 --> 10:05.814
No one can make Plankton happy
like I can.
没有人能让浮游生物开心
就像我可以的那样。

10:05.814 --> 10:08.114
We are soulmates,
and we're going to get married
我们是灵魂伴侣，
我们要结婚了

10:08.114 --> 10:10.347
and print 1,347 babies.
并打印 1,347 个婴儿。

10:10.347 --> 10:11.647
- 1,000 what?
- 1,000 什么？

10:11.647 --> 10:13.180
- Oh, well,
you're really in love.
- 哦，好吧，
你真的恋爱了。

10:13.180 --> 10:14.347
I won't stand in your way.
我不会挡你的路。

10:14.347 --> 10:15.880
Plankton's all yours.
浮游生物都是你的了。

10:15.880 --> 10:16.880
- Yeah!
- 是的！

10:16.880 --> 10:17.980
- No!
- 不！

10:17.980 --> 10:19.347
The whole point
of this scheme
整个要点
该计划的

10:19.347 --> 10:21.180
was for me
to get Karen back,
是给我的
为了让凯伦回来，

10:21.180 --> 10:22.814
and now
you're ruining it!
现在
你毁了它！

10:22.814 --> 10:24.014
- Sorry, Plankton.
- 对不起，浮游生物。

10:24.014 --> 10:26.047
You just said such
nice things to me.
你刚才说了这样的话
对我来说很好的事情。

10:26.047 --> 10:27.347
- Wait a second.
- 等一下。

10:27.347 --> 10:29.180
You're not just
being a jerk?
你不只是
是个混蛋？

10:29.180 --> 10:31.280
You mean,
you cooked this whole
你的意思是，
你把这整个都煮了

10:31.280 --> 10:33.847
stupid scheme up
to win me back?
愚蠢的计划
把我赢回来？

10:33.847 --> 10:35.347
- Of course I did.
- 我当然这么做了。

10:35.347 --> 10:37.680
I'd do anything
for you, baby,
我愿意做任何事
为了你，宝贝，

10:37.680 --> 10:40.014
even hang out with
this moron.
甚至一起出去玩
这个白痴。

10:40.014 --> 10:41.347
- Oh, that is so sweet!
- 哦，那太甜了！

10:41.347 --> 10:43.180
- Get over here, you.
- 过来，你。

10:43.180 --> 10:44.680
- [smooches]
- [亲吻]

10:44.680 --> 10:47.847
Ew, it's that
fat screen saver again.
呃，就是那个
又胖了屏幕保护程序。

10:47.847 --> 10:49.080
- What?
- 什么？

10:49.080 --> 10:50.580
[smacking]
- Now, Karen, take it easy.
[咂嘴]
- 现在，凯伦，放轻松。

10:50.580 --> 10:51.814
- I'm gonna go now.
[smacking continues]
- 我现在要走了。
[继续打巴掌]

10:51.814 --> 10:53.314
- My motherboard
was right about you.
- 我的主板
关于你的看法是正确的。

10:53.314 --> 10:54.814
She warned me about you.
- [yelping]
她警告我关于你的事。
- [尖叫]

10:54.814 --> 10:57.114
- And I should have
listened to her.
- 我应该有
听她说。

10:57.114 --> 10:59.247
[Plankton screams]
[浮游生物的尖叫声]

[浮游生物的尖叫声]